            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:0;padding:2px 4px}h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 4px}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}}</style><h3>What's new in Keeploop 0.27.19</h3><ul><li>Your AI app can now put real links in the mail it drafts or sends. It writes [text](https://...) in the body and the reader sees a clickable "text" (web and mailto links only). Replies stay in the same thread and quote the earlier messages below, links included. A reply with links leaves off your rich signature.</li></ul>]]></description>
